    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Papepo Keeper is a lightweight admin diagnostic: enter a same-site URL, load it in a guest sandbox, and list resources over 150KB.</p>\n<p>Pairs well with <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/papepo-local-webp-converter/\" rel=\"ugc\">Papepo Local WebP Converter</a>. More tools at <a href=\"https://papepo.uk\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">papepo.uk</a>.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload <code>papepo-keeper</code> to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code>.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin.</li>\n<li>Open <strong>Tools <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Papepo Keeper</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Removed donation link.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Same-origin URL hardening; i18n recommendation CTAs; link to Local WebP Converter.</li>\n<li>Requires PHP 7.4; Tested up to 7.1; uninstall.php stub.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
